    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddc1 Welcome to Caramel Creek \ud83c\udf42</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes happiness means leaving everything behind.<br>In <strong>Caramel Creek</strong>, you play as someone who\u2019s grown weary of the city grind \u2014 the deadlines, the crowds, the constant rush.<br>With your savings in hand and a heart full of quiet dreams, you pack up and move to the countryside near the picturesque town of Caramel Creek.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f There, nestled beside the gentle river that shares the town\u2019s name, you find a run-down little house. It\u2019s far from perfect \u2014 but full of promise.<br>And you make a decision: <strong>you\u2019ll turn it into a cozy caf\u00e9</strong>, a place for city folks, locals, and wanderers alike to gather, rest, and sip something warm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game about coffee \u2014 it\u2019s a story of <strong>finding your place in the world</strong>. Of building something with your own hands. Something that feels like home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2615 Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Grow and brew</strong> your own coffee from scratch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>Restore and design</strong> your own cozy caf\u00e9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 <strong>Befriend (or avoid)</strong> the strange townsfolk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Unravel mysteries</strong> hidden beneath the town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc6 <strong>Live at your pace</strong> \u2014 no pressure, no deadlines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Pixel art world</strong> inspired by Stardew Valley and Twin Peaks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf05 <strong>Explore a living world</strong> with dynamic day-night cycles, weather, and changing seasons<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/034177a5da6573a0f90116f793c3801d.avif?t=1745961163\" data-has-big width=800 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 <strong>Build your caf\u00e9 from scratch</strong> \u2014 from painting the walls to crafting your first espresso<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/558c58ae780d7ba030b3078539017b05.avif?t=1745961163\" data-has-big width=800 height=476 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Meet the locals</strong> \u2014 each with their own story, personality, and routine<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/6a29cc04f32bf53f74e27f4b3c1bc264.avif?t=1745961163\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Plant and tend coffee bushes</strong>, harvest the beans, and roast them yourself<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/e60e0dfbff2757bbd3b1f3528fcffb42.avif?t=1745961163\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/25e38c64920f3028839b98118bf34a9f.avif?t=1745961163\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade your equipment</strong> to unlock new recipes and personalize your caf\u00e9<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/d85e5ad3711bcba65fa09ee3c15f7395.avif?t=1745961163\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf33 <strong>Decorate the area around your home</strong>, plant trees, place decorations, build fences<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/f82ae2739cd880215e079c9f1ed5a0d0.avif?t=1745961163\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc31 <strong>Austin the cat roams nearby</strong> \u2014 your lazy but lovable companion.\u00a0Find out what actually happened to him<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/a9a17c0025edcf7da3dff3adf7c70c9f.poster.avif?t=1745961163\" width=690 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/a9a17c0025edcf7da3dff3adf7c70c9f.webm?t=1745961163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/a9a17c0025edcf7da3dff3adf7c70c9f.mp4?t=1745961163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 The game is wrapped in gentle music, warm pixel textures, and the quiet joy of doing things your own way.<br><strong>Caramel Creek</strong> isn\u2019t just a caf\u00e9 sim \u2014 it\u2019s a personal story. A place where <strong>everything belongs to you, from day one</strong>.<br>A world you create, and grow into.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddc1 Welcome to Caramel Creek \ud83c\udf42</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes happiness means leaving everything behind.<br>In <strong>Caramel Creek</strong>, you play as someone who\u2019s grown weary of the city grind \u2014 the deadlines, the crowds, the constant rush.<br>With your savings in hand and a heart full of quiet dreams, you pack up and move to the countryside near the picturesque town of Caramel Creek.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f There, nestled beside the gentle river that shares the town\u2019s name, you find a run-down little house. It\u2019s far from perfect \u2014 but full of promise.<br>And you make a decision: <strong>you\u2019ll turn it into a cozy caf\u00e9</strong>, a place for city folks, locals, and wanderers alike to gather, rest, and sip something warm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game about coffee \u2014 it\u2019s a story of <strong>finding your place in the world</strong>. Of building something with your own hands. Something that feels like home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2615 Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Grow and brew</strong> your own coffee from scratch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>Restore and design</strong> your own cozy caf\u00e9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 <strong>Befriend (or avoid)</strong> the strange townsfolk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Unravel mysteries</strong> hidden beneath the town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc6 <strong>Live at your pace</strong> \u2014 no pressure, no deadlines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Pixel art world</strong> inspired by Stardew Valley and Twin Peaks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Features</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf05 <strong>Explore a living world</strong> with dynamic day-night cycles, weather, and changing seasons<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/034177a5da6573a0f90116f793c3801d.avif?t=1745961163\" data-has-big width=800 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 <strong>Build your caf\u00e9 from scratch</strong> \u2014 from painting the walls to crafting your first espresso<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/558c58ae780d7ba030b3078539017b05.avif?t=1745961163\" data-has-big width=800 height=476 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Meet the locals</strong> \u2014 each with their own story, personality, and routine<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/6a29cc04f32bf53f74e27f4b3c1bc264.avif?t=1745961163\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Plant and tend coffee bushes</strong>, harvest the beans, and roast them yourself<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/e60e0dfbff2757bbd3b1f3528fcffb42.avif?t=1745961163\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672660/extras/25e38c64920f3028839b98118bf34a9f.avif?t=1745961163\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade your equipment</strong> to unlock new recipes and personalize your caf\u00e9<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:/